Z||000000||Sweeet86GT||08-05-2001||11:24 AM||||Hi,Names Dave Dixon<BR>Just bought a 1 owner 86 GT.<BR>Been a car guy for longer than I want to say.<BR>Current car is a restored 79 [G-body]Buick Regal with a built 455 street/strip motor.1/4 mile times of 12.50,s.<BR>Anyway on to the Fiero.<BR>My trade is a carpenter and I was working for a Doctor and in his garage was his wifes GT[86000miles] that had a mechanical problem.It had been sitting for 4 years and he wanted it out of the garage.Pop the hood and took alook around to see what the problem was.EGR valve broken away from the manifold.Offered him $500.bucks and it's now sitting in my driveway.Has some body damage,needs paint job[RED].Battery tray gone/Stock stereo kinda wanders away form the station that it's on.Surprised me on how peppy it is.<BR>Been looking at the stuff you guys already know about this sweeet little car and I'm impressed.<BR>So if you don't mind me asking some stooped questions every now and again.<P>------------------<BR>DAVE DIXON<BR>Bay City,MI||||reg||1
